From dea537358eaf7faed88a2623921f96c49b21ac59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:47:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] pm: add an on demand app optimization run

The background dexopt job only runs while the device is idle and
charging, so on devices that are rarely left alone apps can stay on
verify or stale profiles for a long time.

Let Settings start the job through a protected broadcast, show an
ongoing notification with a cancel action and report how many apps
were optimized once the main and supplementary passes are done.
---
